{"seq":4,"slug":"major-works","title":"沃伦·巴菲特·代表成就","stage":"DONE","category":"warren-buffett","categoryLabel":"沃伦·巴菲特","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/major-works","rating":{"composite":3.69,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/34_warren-buffett/4_major-works","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"沃伦-巴菲特-主要著作\">沃伦·巴菲特·主要著作</h1><p>本 hub 考察巴菲特留给世界的<strong>代表性&quot;作品&quot;</strong>——不是某次交易，而是那些可被后人长期研读、复用、评价的产出：他亲手打造的复利机器与跑赢市场的记录、连续 60 年的致股东信与奥马哈股东大会、以及把财富观制度化的捐赠誓言与个人捐赠。每篇都带具体数字、机制拆解与权衡反模式，而非颂扬。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-vs-兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub vs 兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>巴菲特的内容被拆成六个同级 hub，本 hub（主要著作）只回答&quot;他<strong>做出了哪些可流传的代表作</strong>&quot;，与其他五个边界明确：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兄弟 hub</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的区别</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与事业</a></td>\n<td>他<strong>是谁、如何走到这一步</strong></td>\n<td>讲人生轨迹，本 hub 讲产出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">代表贡献</a></td>\n<td>他对世界的<strong>实质贡献</strong>（价值投资体系、伯克希尔帝国、标志性收购）</td>\n<td>讲贡献内容，本 hub 讲&quot;作品形态&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>他<strong>怎么想、用什么方法</strong>（哲学、护城河、与芒格搭档）</td>\n<td>讲方法论，本 hub 讲方法的产物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>主要著作（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td>他<strong>做出了哪些代表作</strong></td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>他<strong>改变了什么、留下什么</strong></td>\n<td>讲后世影响，本 hub 讲作品本身</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>他<strong>被如何质疑与评价</strong></td>\n<td>讲争论，本 hub 讲产出（含其自身局限）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>边界原则：同一事实只在主篇展开。例如标志性收购（喜诗、可口可乐）的细节归 <a href=\"../core-contributions/landmark-investments/\">代表贡献</a>，本 hub 仅在解释&quot;复利引擎&quot;时引用；接班人阿贝尔的完整讨论归 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/succession-and-scale/\">争议与评价</a>，本 hub 仅在涉及&quot;作品的未来&quot;时链接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三章结构与推荐学习路径\">三章结构与推荐学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[投资战绩] --&gt; B[股东沟通]&#10;    B --&gt; C[慈善]&#10;    A1[复利机器] --&gt; A2[战胜市场]&#10;    B1[致股东的信] --&gt; B2[奥马哈股东大会]&#10;    C1[捐赠誓言] --&gt; C2[伟大的捐赠]&#10;    A --&gt; A1&#10;    B --&gt; B1&#10;    C --&gt; C1\">flowchart LR\n    A[投资战绩] --&gt; B[股东沟通]\n    B --&gt; C[慈善]\n    A1[复利机器] --&gt; A2[战胜市场]\n    B1[致股东的信] --&gt; B2[奥马哈股东大会]\n    C1[捐赠誓言] --&gt; C2[伟大的捐赠]\n    A --&gt; A1\n    B --&gt; B1\n    C --&gt; C1</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>一句话</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"investment-record/\">一、投资战绩</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"investment-record/the-compounding-machine\">复利机器</a> · <a href=\"investment-record/beating-the-market\">战胜市场</a></td>\n<td>作品的&quot;硬实力&quot;：可审计的复利结构与超额回报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"communicating-with-shareholders/\">二、股东沟通</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"communicating-with-shareholders/the-annual-letters\">致股东的信</a> · <a href=\"communicating-with-shareholders/the-omaha-meeting\">奥马哈股东大会</a></td>\n<td>作品的&quot;传播力&quot;：书面与口头两翼</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"philanthropy/\">三、慈善</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"philanthropy/the-giving-pledge\">捐赠誓言</a> · <a href=\"philanthropy/the-great-giveaway\">伟大的捐赠</a></td>\n<td>作品的&quot;价值观&quot;：把财富观制度化与个人兑现</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>推荐路径</strong>：按 战绩 → 沟通 → 慈善 顺序阅读。先理解他凭什么被听（投资战绩），再看他如何沟通（信与大会），最后看他把影响力延伸到财富之外（慈善）。每章内两篇为&quot;绝对/相对&quot;&quot;书面/口头&quot;&quot;倡议/实践&quot;的互补对子。</p>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>：建议先浏览 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/investment-philosophy/\">思想与方法 · 投资哲学</a> 了解价值投资基本概念（能力圈、市场先生、护城河），阅读本 hub 会更顺畅。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阅读提示\">阅读提示</h2><p>本 hub 刻意避免颂扬式写法：每篇都包含具体年份/金额/人名、机制流程图、权衡与反模式，并对作品的局限（规模诅咒、捐赠誓言低兑现率、强人格依赖与接班风险）保持诚实。这些&quot;作品&quot;既值得学习，也都带着可被审计的边界。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"investment-record","title":"投资战绩","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/major-works/investment-record","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-compounding-machine","title":"复利机器","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/major-works/investment-record/the-compounding-machine"},{"seq":2,"slug":"beating-the-market","title":"战胜市场","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/major-works/investment-record/beating-the-market"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"communicating-with-shareholders","title":"股东沟通","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/major-works/communicating-with-shareholders","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-annual-letters","title":"致股东的信","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/major-works/communicating-with-shareholders/the-annual-letters"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-omaha-meeting","title":"奥马哈股东大会","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/major-works/communicating-with-shareholders/the-omaha-meeting"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"philanthropy","title":"慈善","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/major-works/philanthropy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-giving-pledge","title":"捐赠誓言","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/major-works/philanthropy/the-giving-pledge"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-great-giveaway","title":"伟大的捐赠","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/major-works/philanthropy/the-great-giveaway"}]}]}